d 'STATASHINY': module to build interactive HTML dashboards, calculators, and data tables from Stata
d
d  statashiny generates interactive HTML dashboards from Stata
d using Bootstrap 5 (layout), DataTables (searchable/sortable
d tables), and Chart.js (live charts). Define numeric and checkbox
d inputs, value cards, data tables from variables in memory, and
d JavaScript-driven visualizations that recompute in the browser --
d no web-dev required. Output is a single self-contained .html file
d you can email, host, or embed as an iframe (pairs naturally with
d webdoc2 reports). 
d
d KW: dashboard; html; interactive; bootstrap; datatables; chartjs; reporting; visualization
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author: Eric Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f statashiny.ado
f statashiny.sthlp
